[x^Ny^K]  (1-yx)/[1-yx - (M-1)x]
[x^Ny^K]  (1-yx) \sum_{i=0}^\infty (yx+(M-1)x)^i

[y^K]  (y+(M-1))^N - y (y+(M-1))^{N-1}
\binom{N}{K} (M-1)^{N-K} - \binom{N-1}{K-1} (M-1)^{N-K}
(M-1)^{N-K} \binom{N-1}{K}

